    {
      "name": "🚀 1. Setup - User Registration & Login",
      "description": "START HERE! Register users with different roles and get their tokens.\n\n**Roles:**\n- `super_admin`: Full platform access, can create exercises\n- `gym_owner`: Can create/manage gyms and challenges\n- `client`: Can join gyms, participate in challenges, log workouts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Register Super Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('Super Admin created:', jsonData.data.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"superadmin@tspark.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SuperAdmin123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Super\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Admin\",\n  \"role\": \"super_admin\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "**IMPORTANT**: Creates a Super Admin account.\n\nSuper Admins can:\n- Create, update, delete exercises\n- Approve/reject gyms\n- Manage all users\n- Full platform access"
